<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>FDR (solid lines) and power (bars) achieved by our method on MiniGPT-4 with the VL-MIA/Flickr dataset, evaluated across various data usage proportions of the test set <math id="S4.F4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\text{test}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>test</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\text{test}}</annotation></semantics></math> and target FDR levels <math id="S4.F4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>. All results are based on the MaxRényi-K% score calculated from three different input components: (a) the image embedding, (b) the generated description, and (c) the instruction combined with the description.</figcaption>
