<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Comparison of detection power on the ArXivTection dataset. We evaluate our method using scaled p-values (<span id="A6.T6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Ours</span>) against the baseline using original p-values (Vanilla) across various LLMs and detection scores at different target FDR levels (<math id="A6.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>). Higher power is highlighted in <span id="A6.T6.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>.</figcaption>
